  m_Name: RedLightPostRepeated
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: RedLightPostRepeated
  dialogueLines:
  - Seriously, stop trying to press it again. Nothing is going to happen.
  - "You\u2019ve already pressed it. How many times do I have to tell you?"
  - "Stop pressing the button. It\u2019s not going to do anything."
  - Again? Really? Nothing is going to happen this time either.
  - The button has already done its job. Please stop pressing it.
  - You keep pressing it, but nothing is going to change.
  - "I\u2019m telling you, it does nothing now. Stop pressing it."
  - Why are you still pressing the button? I promise, nothing will happen.
  - The player is still trying to activate it. This is getting rather unnecessary.
  - "Enough with the button. It\u2019s done. Leave it alone."
  canRepeat: 1
